From 3206b884b5762bbe0e25083e28740f03bc243aca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 03:08:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] borg: let every class but Mage and Rogue buy the Black Market
 Rod of Teleport Other

The Black Market exception for the Rod of Teleport Other is meant for
classes that cannot cast Teleport Other themselves ("mage and rogue can
cast teleport away"), but it read != CLASS_MAGE && == CLASS_ROGUE, so
it applied to Rogues only. Rogues saved gold for a rod they do not need,
and other classes fell back to the general Black Market rule that
waits for much more gold.

Use != for both classes, as the Recall and Speed rod exceptions next to
it do.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#17.

(cherry picked from commit d752bad27185ee7a709459b0e83186d9b0d16d7f)
---
 src/borg/borg-store-buy.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c b/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
index 81f22c79f..2ebcb739b 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@ static bool borg_good_buy(borg_item *item, int who, int ware)
                     /* mage and rogue can cast teleport away */
                     (item->sval == sv_rod_teleport_other
                         && borg.trait[BI_CLASS] != CLASS_MAGE
-                        && borg.trait[BI_CLASS] == CLASS_ROGUE)
+                        && borg.trait[BI_CLASS] != CLASS_ROGUE)
                     || (item->sval == sv_rod_illumination
                         && (!borg.trait[BI_ALITE]))))
             || (obj_kind_can_browse(&k_info[item->kind])
